{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-109","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：截差无理线段与中项无理线段与无理线段","englishTitle":"If from a medial area a rational area be subtracted, there arise two other irrational straight lines, either a first apotome of a medial straight line or a straight line which produces with a rational area a medial whole.","book":10,"number":109,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.109","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.109/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":109,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-109@raw-1a80fbffd54c737a","contentId":"euclid-10-109","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a80fbffd54c737a7ffdb0f5f64269ea278517d5b96a5132096c89be75497f6c","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-109.statement","euclid-10-109.proof.1","euclid-10-109.proof.2","euclid-10-109.construction.1","euclid-10-109.proof.3","euclid-10-109.proof.4","euclid-10-109.proof.5","euclid-10-109.proof.6","euclid-10-109.proof.7","euclid-10-109.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-109.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-109","revisionId":"euclid-10-109@raw-1a80fbffd54c737a","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe962e720a1aaeeb1fb6aaf5189c3292be4964e01182102d9c8e431f1e5eaba7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If from a medial area a rational area be subtracted, there arise two other irrational straight lines, either a first apotome of a medial straight line or a straight line which produces with a rational area a medial whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从中项无理线段区域减去有理面积,则产生另外两个无理线段,或者中项无理线段个区域的第一个截差无理线段,或者产生有理面积 a 中项无理线段整条直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-109.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-109","revisionId":"euclid-10-109@raw-1a80fbffd54c737a","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e4d043b5a1f95f4ab8873144cc4ee26ae0447b4af85c6933e966c1fb88dd674","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For from the medial area BC let the rational area BD be subtracted."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从中项无理线段地区BC减去有理面积、BD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-109.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-109","revisionId":"euclid-10-109@raw-1a80fbffd54c737a","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"91f1e87a99dfd448483929aff75ec023720a527367daf5a35e644de3dbf2fdd8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the side of the remainder EC becomes one of two irrational straight lines, either a first apotome of a medial straight line or a straight line which produces with a rational area a medial whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,其余的EC成为两个无理线段中的一方,要么是中项无理线段中的第一个截差无理线段,要么是产生有理面积整中项无理线段整条直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-109.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-109","revisionId":"euclid-10-109@raw-1a80fbffd54c737a","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"66e854bb69c7148e08e45ea343c83eda26e9e3f012b62555a15f3ee179980bc8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a rational straight line FG be set out, and let the areas be similarly applied."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出有理线段 FG区域,并同样适用这些区域。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-109.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-109","revisionId":"euclid-10-109@raw-1a80fbffd54c737a","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"347226d6bab1bc452695b5df0bb3a7c411c148dc6c8108021ca1f17c0ea7ed46","citations":["euclid-10-13","euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It follows then that FH is rational and incommensurable in length with FG, while KF is rational and commensurable in length with FG; therefore FH, FK are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] therefore KH is an apotome, and FK the annex to it. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FH长为有理,不可公度长为FG,KF长为有理,长度可公度长为FG;因此,FH长为有理线段,FK长为有理线段,KH长为截差无理线段,FK长为附件。 [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-109.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-109","revisionId":"euclid-10-109@raw-1a80fbffd54c737a","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9141f793740dde701e9b77cee1a0c89b2aaf3c94de330b9a8d695acb778ac6bc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the square on HF is greater than the square on FK either by the square on a straight line commensurable with HF or by the square on a straight line incommensurable with it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,HF的正方形比FK的正方形要高,或者比可公度直线正方形HF直线可公度高,或者比正方形直线不可公度高。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-109.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-109","revisionId":"euclid-10-109@raw-1a80fbffd54c737a","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"611a4b5bfbb0c31ee313c8c8414885d1b9a34288e026a494628dc23679bdff1c","citations":["euclid-10-def-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If then the square on HF is greater than the square on FK by the square on a straight line commensurable with HF, while the annex FK is commensurable in length with the rational straight line FG set out, KH is a second apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果HF上的正方形比FK上的正方形长,加上可公度直线上HF直线上的正方形,而附件FK则比有理线段FG长度可公度大,则KH是第二截差无理线段。 [[X. Deff. III. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-109.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-109","revisionId":"euclid-10-109@raw-1a80fbffd54c737a","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3d93b36739f90fc4c725c3d982a3a7708e630b0e7f3f0f63e7a9ed78d4ac8992","citations":["euclid-10-92"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But FG is rational; so that the side of LH, that is, of EC, is a first apotome of a medial straight line. [[X. 92](/principles/euclid-10-92)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FG是有理,LH的一方,即EC,是中项无理线段的最初的截差无理线段。 [[X. 92](/principles/euclid-10-92)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-109.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-109","revisionId":"euclid-10-109@raw-1a80fbffd54c737a","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2a30d21d54baa3b54e4ae3cf40dd55b2b71050ca24a1e6f4a8bee42d01bfc3d3","citations":["euclid-10-def-15","euclid-10-95"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if the square on HF is greater than the square on FK by the square on a straight line incommensurable with HF, while the annex FK is commensurable in length with the rational straight line FG set out, KH is a fifth apotome; [[X. Deff. III. 5](/principles/euclid-10-def-15)] so that the side of EC is a straight line which produces with a rational area a medial whole. [[X. 95](/principles/euclid-10-95)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果HF上的正方形比FK上的正方形长,加上不可公度与HF直线上的正方形,而附件FK比长度可公度有理线段FG,则KH是第第五截差无理线段号;因此,EC的一面是直线,产生有理面积个中项无理线段个整线。 [[X. Deff. III. 5](/principles/euclid-10-def-15)] [[X. 95](/principles/euclid-10-95)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-109.source","contentId":"euclid-10-109","revisionId":"euclid-10-109@raw-1a80fbffd54c737a","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"246d1f429e9fd455a70690aa9d5ad27d2f3b19768190920b64c099f8ec521581","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.109/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.109\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-109:euclid-10-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-109","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-109.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.109","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.109/","sourceLabel":"X. 13"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-109:euclid-10-73:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-109","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-109.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-73","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"pe